@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@lifecycleOrderId = example-lifecycle-0001
@cancelOrderId = example-cancel-0001
@settlementOrderId = example-settlement-0001

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### ライフサイクル example 用の注文を作成
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: example-create-lifecycle

{
  "orderId": "{{lifecycleOrderId}}",
  "customerId": "customer-example-0001",
  "currency": "JPY",
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-EXAMPLE-001",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPriceMinor": 1500
    }
  ],
  "address": {
    "recipientName": "Taro Yamada",
    "postalCode": "100-0001",
    "prefecture": "Tokyo",
    "city": "Chiyoda",
    "addressLine1": "1-1-1 Marunouchi",
    "addressLine2": null
  }
}

### 注文を取得
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}

### 注文一覧の先頭ページを取得
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?limit=2

### 決済待ちにする
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/submit

### 支払済みにする
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/pay

### 出荷準備を開始する
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/start-fulfillment

### 出荷する
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/ship
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "TRACK-EXAMPLE-0001"
}

### 配達済みにする
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/deliver

### 返金済みにする
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{lifecycleOrderId}}/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountMinor": 3000,
  "currency": "JPY"
}

### キャンセル example 用の注文を作成
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{cancelOrderId}}",
  "customerId": "customer-example-0001",
  "currency": "JPY",
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-EXAMPLE-002",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPriceMinor": 2000
    }
  ],
  "address": {
    "recipientName": "Hanako Yamada",
    "postalCode": "150-0002",
    "prefecture": "Tokyo",
    "city": "Shibuya",
    "addressLine1": "2-2-2 Shibuya"
  }
}

### 注文をキャンセルする
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{cancelOrderId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "customer requested"
}

### ID cursor を指定して次のページを取得する
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders?after={{cancelOrderId}}&limit=2

### 累積バリデーションの Problem Details を確認する
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: ja

{
  "orderId": "",
  "customerId": "",
  "currency": "JPY",
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "bad sku!!",
      "quantity": -1,
      "unitPriceMinor": 1500
    }
  ],
  "address": {
    "recipientName": "x",
    "postalCode": "x",
    "prefecture": "x",
    "city": "x",
    "addressLine1": "x"
  }
}

### 日本語の Not Found Problem Details を確認する
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/example-order-not-found
Accept-Language: ja

### 消込 example 用の注文を作成
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{settlementOrderId}}",
  "customerId": "customer-example-0002",
  "currency": "JPY",
  "lines": [
    {
      "sku": "SKU-SETTLEMENT-001",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPriceMinor": 1500
    }
  ],
  "address": {
    "recipientName": "Jiro Yamada",
    "postalCode": "530-0001",
    "prefecture": "Osaka",
    "city": "Osaka",
    "addressLine1": "3-3-3 Umeda"
  }
}

### 消込可能な決済待ち状態にする（この後 examples/settlement/2026-08-06.csv を利用）
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{settlementOrderId}}/submit
